---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const title = "Privacy Policy | SKYON IT SOLUTIONS";
const description = "Privacy Policy for SKYON IT SOLUTIONS. Learn how we handle your data.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-[48rem] mx-auto text-text-body">
    <div class="mb-8 p-4 bg-brand-primary/10 border border-brand-primary text-brand-primary rounded-md font-medium text-center">
      Draft pending legal review
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-text-primary tracking-tight mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-12 mb-4">Project Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        If you use the inquiry form while no form endpoint is configured, your browser opens WhatsApp with the details you entered prefilled in a message. The message is not sent until you review and send it in WhatsApp. WhatsApp processes information according to its own terms and privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-12 mb-4">Other Contact Methods</h2>
      <p>
        If you contact us by email or choose to use another contact channel, the information you share may be processed by that service. If a third-party form provider is enabled in the future, this notice must be updated to identify it and explain its handling of submitted information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-12 mb-4">Data Deletion</h2>
      <p>
        You can request deletion of information you have sent to SKYON by emailing <strong>{SITE.email}</strong>. Information held by third-party services may also be subject to those providers' own policies and processes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-12 mb-4">Website Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Please note that website analytics tracking will be added at a later date. This Privacy Policy will be updated to reflect analytics data collection practices once they are implemented.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
